#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0658 expect=noViolation domain=ADNCA
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when NCAXFN is present with a value other than 1 or null in an ADNCA v1.0 dataset.
#note "NCAXFN is populated with the only permitted value (1), so the rule executes and does not fire"
dataset ADNCA
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col NCAXFN type=Num
col PARAMCD type=Char
col NFRLT type=Num
col AFRLT type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | CONC | 0 | 0.5
---
